INFO  2026-04-22T04:33:51 +0ms service=decision-log taskID=tsk_db36760da001wY96omQ3QhVvR8 key=naming_convention value=## File and Symbol Naming Conventions
- React components: PascalCase (e.g., `StockHeader.tsx`, `ChartContainer.tsx`)
- TypeScript types/interfaces: PascalCase (e.g., `StockQuote`, `ChartDataPoint`)
- Hooks: camelCase prefixed with 'use' (e.g., `useStockData`, `useChartData`)
- Utility functions: camelCase (e.g., `formatPrice`, `fetchApi`)
- CSS files: kebab-case matching component name (e.g., `stock-header.css`)
- API routes: kebab-case paths (e.g., `/api/stock/:symbol/quote`)
- Constants: UPPER_SNAKE_CASE for true constants phase=architect decision logged
